BT 1 0 0 1 0 121 Tm /F1 9 Tf 13 TL (With recent advancements in voice recognition, conversational interfaces \(ie, those that use natural language as inputs) Tj T* (and outputs\) have begun to emerge. Conversational agents \(such as Apple\222s Siri or Amazon\222s Alexa\) may be a more) Tj T* (natural medium through which individuals engage with technology. Humans respond and converse with nonhuman) Tj T* (agents in ways that mirror emotional and social discourse dynamics when discussing behavioral health [10] and their) Tj T* (capacity to act as first responders has already been evaluated [11]. Theoretically, conversational interfaces may be) Tj T* (better positioned than visually oriented mobile apps to deliver structured, manualized therapies because in addition to) Tj T* -0.076863 Tw (delivering therapeutic content, they can mirror therapeutic process. Indeed, Bickmore et al demonstrated that a carefully) Tj T* 0 Tw (designed health-related conversational agent could establish a therapeutic relationship with adults attempting to) Tj T* -0.06835 Tw (increase exercise [10]. The intervention was an embodied conversational agent, that is, it was designed with a graphical) Tj T* 0 Tw (face to mirror human interactions that are typically face-to-face.) Tj T* ET
