BT 1 0 0 1 0 95 Tm /F1 9 Tf 13 TL (Given the variability in quality of available mental health apps, a conversational agent was created to integrate 15 out of) Tj T* (the 16 evidence-based recommendations for app development [4] as follows: built using a CBT framework; addressing) Tj T* (both anxiety and low mood; designed for use by nonclinical populations; incorporating automated tailoring; reporting of) Tj T* -0.053329 Tw (thoughts, feelings, or behaviors; recommending activities; provision of mental health information; real-time engagement;) Tj T* 0 Tw (activities explicitly linked to specific reported mood problems; encouraging non) Tj /F3 9 Tf 13 TL (n) Tj /F1 9 Tf 13 TL (technology-based activities;) Tj T* -0.077463 Tw (gamification and intrinsic motivation to engage; reminders to engage; simple and intuitive interface and interactions; and) Tj T* 0 Tw (including links to crisis support services. While these recommendations were created in the context of mobile phone) Tj T* (apps, to our knowledge, their relevance in the context of a conversational interface has never been tested.) Tj T* ET
