BT 1 0 0 1 0 82 Tm /F1 9 Tf 13 TL (Thus, the objective of this study was to assess the feasibility of delivering CBT in a conversational interface via an) Tj T* (automated bot in a way that facilitates engagement and reduction in symptoms. The current study compared outcomes) Tj T* (from 2 weeks of a CBT-oriented conversational agent \(Woebot\), or an information control group \(National Institute of) Tj T* -0.109863 Tw (Mental Health\222s [NIMH] ebook\) in a nonclinical college population. We hypothesized that conversation with a therapeutic) Tj T* 0 Tw (process-oriented conversational agent would lead to greater improvement in symptoms relative to the information) Tj T* (control group. We also hypothesized that receiving psychoeducational material in a conversational manner would be) Tj T* (more acceptable to those who received it.) Tj T* ET
