BT 1 0 0 1 0 134 Tm /F1 9 Tf 13 TL (Woebot is an automated conversational agent designed to deliver CBT in the format of brief, daily conversations and) Tj T* (mood tracking. Woebot is used within an instant messenger app that is platform agnostic and can be used either on a) Tj T* (desktop or mobile device. Each interaction begins with a general inquiry about context \(eg, \223What\222s going on in your) Tj T* (world right now?\224\), and mood \(eg, \223How are you feeling?\224\) with responses provided as word or emoji images to) Tj T* (represent affect in that moment. After gathering mood data, participants are presented with core concepts related to) Tj T* (CBT by link to short video, or by way of short \223word games\224 designed to facilitate teaching participants about cognitive) Tj T* (distortions. The first day included an \223onboarding\224 process that introduced the bot, adding that while the bot may seem) Tj T* (like a person, it is closer to a \223choose your own adventure self-help book\224 and therefore not fully capable of) Tj T* (understanding what the needs of the user may be. The bot also briefly explained CBT and notified the user that while a) Tj T* (psychologist was \223keeping an eye on things\224 \(ie, monitoring\), this was not happening in real time and thus the service) Tj T* -0.010052 Tw (should not be used as a replacement for therapy. In addition, participants were encouraged to call 911 for emergencies.) Tj T* 0 Tw ET
