BT 1 0 0 1 0 69 Tm /F1 9 Tf 13 TL (To our knowledge this is the first randomized trial of a nonembodied text-based conversational agent designed for) Tj T* (therapeutic use. The objective of the study was to explore whether a fully automated conversational agent based on) Tj T* -0.009056 Tw (CBT principals could deliver a therapeutic experience to college students over a 2-week period. We hypothesized that a) Tj T* 0 Tw (conversational agent built to incorporate both evidence-based guidelines for the development of mental health apps as) Tj T* (well as hypothesized therapeutic process variables would be highly engaging, more acceptable, and would lead to) Tj T* (greater reductions in symptoms of anxiety and depression relative to an information control group.) Tj T* ET
Q
Q
