BT 1 0 0 1 0 43 Tm /F1 9 Tf 13 TL (The study confirmed that after 2 weeks, those in the Woebot group experienced a significant reduction in depression,) Tj T* (thus our hypothesis was partially supported. Woebot was associated with a high level of engagement with most) Tj T* (individuals using the bot nearly every day and was generally viewed more favorably than the information-only) Tj T* (comparison.) Tj T* ET
Q
